  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Commitment Program Eligibility Details Object > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L007: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject MUST have a top-level property key \\\"CommitmentPrograms\\\".\"",
    "  L010: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject MAY contain additional data generator-defined top-level property keys.\"",
    "  L011: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject MUST have property keys that begin with the string \\\"x_\\\" unless it is a FOCUS-defined property key.\"",
    "  L012: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L013: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST be of type Array.\"",
    "    L014: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST contain one or more objects.\"",
    "    L015: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST be of type JSON Object.\"",
    "    L016: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST have a property key \\\"ProgramType\\\".\"",
    "    L017: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MAY contain additional data generator-defined property keys.\"",
    "    L018: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST have property keys that begin with the string \\\"x_\\\" unless it is a FOCUS-defined property key.\"",
    "    L019: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST be of type String.\"",
    "    L020: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST NOT be null.\"",
    "    L021: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST correspond to a *commitment program* type supported by the service provider.\"",
    "    L022: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST equal [CommitmentDiscountType](#datasets.costandusage.commitmentdiscounttype) for one object in CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms when CommitmentDiscountType is not null.\"",
    "    L023: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityDetailsObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType SHOULD correspond to terminology disclosed by the service provider in public documentation.\""
  ],
